#. module: no_pdf_password_protection_account
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/no_pdf_password_protection_account/models/ir_actions_report.py:0
msgid ""
"<p>The attached document is password protected. Please open it with the "
"password we have shared with you.</p>"
msgstr "<p>附件文档已设置密码保护。请使用我们告知您的密码打开。</p>"

#. module: no_pdf_password_protection_account
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:no_pdf_password_protection_account.field_account_move_send_wizard__x_pdf_notice_in_email
msgid ""
"Adds the notice configured on the invoice report above the message, so the "
"customer is not left with a file that will not open. It is only added when "
"the document really was protected."
msgstr "将发票报表上配置的提示加在邮件正文上方，以免客户拿到打不开的文件。仅在文档确实已受保护时才会添加。"

#. module: no_pdf_password_protection_account
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_no_pdf_password_protection_account
msgid ""
"Bridge between PDF Password Protection and Accounting. Odoo builds the "
"invoice PDF it emails through a different code path than the Print button, "
"which would otherwise deliver an unencrypted invoice to the customer. This "
"module closes that gap and gives every document its own recipient's "
"password. Requires the free module 'PDF Password Protection', which is where"
" the password source and encryption strength are configured; install that "
"one first and this add-on installs itself automatically once Accounting is "
"present. It has no settings of its own."
msgstr ""
"PDF密码保护与会计之间的桥梁。Odoo 通过与“打印”按钮不同的代码路径生成其通过电子邮件发送的发票 "
"PDF，否则客户会收到未加密的发票。本模块弥补了这一缺口，并让每份文档使用其收件人自己的密码。需要免费模块“PDF密码保护”，密码来源和加密强度都在其中配置；请先安装该模块，一旦安装了会计，本附加模块会自动安装。本模块没有自己的设置。"

